  "description": "The coming-of-age story of a kitten who finds herself in the middle of a dog clan!\n\nHong-Seol, a cat-human hybrid, was abandoned by her parents because she couldn’t use her inner energy. After a miserable death, she opens her eyes to find herself back at the moment just before she died.\n\n *\"You are the child I’ve been searching for. Would you like to learn martial arts from me?\"*\n\nWith nowhere else to go, Hong-Seol is approached by the formidable “dog” shu-in clan, the Grand Patriarch of the Namgung Clan, who extends a helping hand. To survive, Hong-Seol enters the Namgung Clan. \n\n *“If they find out I’m a cat shu-in, I’ll be kicked out for sure!”* \n\nWhether they know of Hong-Seol’s daily struggle to walk on thin ice or not, these dogs come to visit her every day, wagging their tails. Except for one: the prickly eldest dog, Namgung Baek.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
